[00:14.06]1. God’s Word and all it promises
[00:18.74]Give reason to endure.
[00:23.32]The things you’ve learned and come to love
[00:27.62]Are all well-founded and sure.
[00:31.90]Be stabilized in holy faith,
[00:36.56]Keeping God’s day close in mind.
[00:41.00]Stand firm in your integrity;
[00:46.24]By tests you will be refined.
[00:53.24]2. Maintain the love you had at first,
[00:57.58]Which somehow could be lost.
[01:02.66]Despite the trials you will meet,
[01:06.32]Endure no matter the cost.
[01:10.70]Whatever test may come your way,
[01:15.26]Never yield to doubt or fear.
[01:20.64]Jehovah will provide escape,
[01:24.32]Our God ever will be near.
[01:31.94]3. All those enduring to the end
[01:36.54]Are those who will be saved.
[01:41.00]The book of life will list their names,
[01:45.14]A record clearly engraved.
[01:49.48]So let endurance be your aim;
[01:54.14]Let it have its work complete.
[01:59.44]Jehovah’s favor you will know;
[02:03.24]With joy you will be replete.
